OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over crash death near
OL,4,Auniversity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA van driver has been arrested over the
OL,7,Fdeath of a man in his 80s in a crash
OL,8,Foutside a university, which saw another
OL,9,Fperson seriously injured.
OL,11,FThe crash between a white Peugeot
OL,12,FPartner van and a blue Vauxhall Agila
OL,13,Fhappened at the entrance to Lancaster
OL,14,FUniversity on Saturday just before
OL,15,F20:00 GMT, Lancashire Police said.
OL,17,FThe force said the man, who was a
OL,18,Fpassenger in the Vauxhall, was
OL,19,Fpronounced dead at the scene on the
OL,20,Fcity's A6 Scotforth Road and the driver
OL,21,Fof the car, a man in his 60s, was in a
OL,22,Fcritical condition in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
